What in this tree pins the TEXT of generated code (gh-ocannl-712). A codegen change re-runs
every golden listed here, on the backend whose family it names, and every test source under
it. The rules are stated in test/support/codegen_text_scan.ml; the counts scanned go to
stderr, since a tally in a golden moves on every correct addition anywhere (gh-ocannl-665).

